<p>A reason “that orders” the world.</p>
<ol>
<li><a class="thread" href="#t-word">The Word</a> <a href="#k-ben">Ben of Somewhere</a> <b>adapts</b> <a href="#k-ana">Ana</a> (<cite>Ben 1.1</cite>): “In the beginning.”</li>
<li><a class="thread" href="#t-word">The Word</a> <a href="#k-cal">Cal</a> <b>quotes</b> <a href="#k-ben">Ben of Somewhere</a> (<cite>Cal 2</cite>): “As Ben said.”</li>
</ol>
</section>
<section class="t-law">
